---
description: Tripwire project rules (worktrees, memory limits, contracts, honesty)
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md at the repo root. In short:
- Edit only inside your own git worktree and only the files your stream owns (AGENTS.md §4).
- Code against `app/types.ts`; do not change it.
- Run installs, tests and servers through `scripts/memguard.sh -- <cmd>`.
- Never read, print or commit `.env` files or API keys.
- No hardcoded answers; every sponsor call has a timeout and a logged fallback.
- TypeScript ESM, `.js` import suffixes, vitest tests in `test/`.
